{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54665","headline":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 三 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日生晕，上下两重交。\n必有彼疆亡将过（京本作「军亡将帅」），中谋独霸不成韬，终是举（京本作「起」）枪刀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54665.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54665","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}